<view class="page-shell practical-page">
  <view class="page-title">实操技能</view>
  <text class="page-subtitle">把考点放回操作场景，按准备、步骤、风险和易错点复习。</text>

  <view class="guide-note">
    <t-icon name="info-circle" size="32rpx" />
    <text>技能卡用于复习作业要点，现场操作仍须遵守单位规程、培训和监护要求。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="title" class="skill-group">
    <view class="skill-group__heading">
      <view class="skill-group__title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <text class="skill-group__note">{{item.note}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="skill-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{item.skills}}"
        wx:for-item="skill"
        wx:key="id"
        class="skill-card"
        data-id="{{skill.id}}"
        bind:tap="onOpenSkill"
      >
        <view class="skill-card__icon"><t-icon name="{{skill.icon}}" size="38rpx" /></view>
        <view class="skill-card__content">
          <view class="skill-card__title">{{skill.title}}</view>
          <text class="skill-card__summary">{{skill.summary}}</text>
        </view>
        <t-icon name="chevron-right" size="32rpx" color="#86868b" />
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
